* JUSTIFICATION: Inductive machine - use CS for startup

c_pf_coil_turn_peak_input = 4.22e4, 4.22e4, 4.22e4, 4.22e4, 4.3e4, 4.3e4, 4.3e4, 4.3e4
* DESCRIPTION:   Peak current per turn input for pf coil i (A)
* JUSTIFICATION:  

